<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" dir="ltr"><head><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" data-next-head=""/><meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" data-next-head=""/><meta name="HandheldFriendly" content="True" data-next-head=""/><meta name="MobileOptimized" content="320" data-next-head=""/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.va.gov/disability/compensation-rates/special-monthly-compensation-rates/" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.va.gov/disability/compensation-rates/special-monthly-compensation-rates/" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:type" content="website" data-next-head=""/><meta name="DC.Date" content="2025-12-03" data-next-head=""/><title data-next-head="">Current Special Monthly Compensation Rates | Veterans Affairs</title><meta name="description" content="VA special monthly compensation (SMC) is a higher rate of compensation that we pay to Veterans as well as their spouses, surviving spouses, and parents with certain needs or disabilities. Find the 2026 special monthly compensation rates that may apply to you." data-next-head=""/><link rel="image_src" href="https://www.va.gov/img/design/logo/va-og-image.png" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Veterans Affairs" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:title" content="Current special monthly compensation rates | Veterans Affairs" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:description" content="VA special monthly compensation (SMC) is a higher rate of compensation that we pay to Veterans as well as their spouses, surviving spouses, and parents with certain needs or disabilities. Find the 2026 special monthly compensation rates that may apply to you." data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.va.gov/img/design/logo/va-og-image.png" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs" data-